The Saiphai Village Council Land Pass Management System has been built and deployed with online and encrypted offline synchronization.
Key Capabilities
Official Letterhead & A4 Certificate Layout:
Letterhead:
Office of the
VILLAGE COUNCIL / COURT
SAIPHAI, MIZORAM.
BILKHAWTHLIR RD BLOCK, KOLASIB DISTRICT, MIZORAM : 796091/796101
A4 Printable View & PDF Archival: Specially formatted with @page { size: A4; } for direct browser printing and 1-click saving as PDF.
Auto-Show After Save: Adding any new Land Record automatically opens the printable certificate for review and document archival.
Official Conditions & Restrictions (Mizo):
Huan ram hi ramri ziah anga pek a ni a.
An ri-te inkar chin a huam ang.
Pekni atanga kum thum (3) chhungin a enkawlin kut a thlak ngei tur a ni.
Thlai phun lova, pass ringawt a nih chuan cancel theih a ni ang.
VC ten tul bik thil ah an cancel thei ang.
Vantlang leh sawrkar pawimawh ah a tul angin zangnadawmna pe lo in hman theih a ni ang.
Signatories: Official President LALTHANSANGA signatory with Village Council rubber stamp seal and Secretary line.
Pass Types & Automatic Serial Generation:
Huan Ram Pass: Agricultural / plantation pass starting at SPH/VC/HR/1001.
In Hmun Pass: Residential plot pass starting at SPH/VC/IH/1001.
Sequentially calculates next available pass numbers based on existing registry records.
Form & Boundaries with Interactive Map & NOC Photo Picker:
Owner details, father's/mother's name, phone number, and area extent.
Google Map Picker: Interactive coordinate picker with Saiphai presets (Vengpui, Bazar Veng, Hmar Veng, Chhim Veng, Bilkhawthlir RD Block Rd, Vaphai Rd, Tlawng River) and device GPS locator.
Four Cardinal Boundaries: Hmar (North), Chhak (East), Thlang (West), and Chhim (South).
NOC Document Picker: Photo upload and preview for Village Council No Objection Certificates.
QR Code Verification: Generates embedded QR code verification and provides an in-app verification tool.
Offline / Online Synchronization & AES-GCM Encrypted Local Cache:
Firestore offline persistence with client-side AES-GCM (256-bit) encryption for device storage.
Online/Offline status banner and queueing of offline mutations that automatically synchronize once internet connectivity is restored.
Authentication & Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):
Google Login via Firebase Auth.
Mobile OTP Service: 10-digit phone login with 6-digit OTP verification code.
Council Master Key: Admin key is 0000 to unlock administrative privileges (Add, Edit, Delete, User Permissions, and Audit Logs).
Regular members have view-only access to browse and print certificates.
Audit Log: Searchable, filterable activity history with CSV export for Village Council archives.
