File	Purpose
index.php	Public portal: Instant Land Pass verification by Pass Number and direct login/register cards.
login.php	Server-side login form for Village Council Secretaries and Master Authority Key (785392).
register.php	Secretary registration with dedicated council creation, custom starting numbers, and ₹299 verification proof upload.
dashboard.php	Main Land Pass registry strictly scoped to the secretary's village with search, statistics, and filters (All, Huan Ram, In Hmun).
