Mizoram Village Council Land Pass Registry System Chungchang (Chipchiar Taka Hrilhfiahna)
He application hi Mizoram Village Council (V/C) te tana bika siam, Huan Ram leh In Hmun Land Pass felfai, rintlak leh changkang taka enkawl, chhuah, leh chhinchhiahna (Electronic Land Registry System) a ni. Hmanlai lehkha bu thil hlui, chhia leh boral thei laka fihlimin, khawtlang rorelna leh ram pek chungchanga rintlak leh zahawm taka digital hmanga vawn thatna hmanrua a ni.
1. A Tum Bulpui (Main Purpose)
Khawtlang Ram Rorelna Tihchangkan: Village Council-ten ramri leh pass an pek te felfai tak leh rualkhai taka chhinchhiah.
Inbumna leh Pass Lem Venna: Pass tinah QR Code leh Serial Number danglam bik dah a ni a, tu pawhin phone camera hmangin pass dik a nih leh nih loh an finfiah zung zung thei.
Ramri Felfai (GPS & Boundary): Ramri palite (Hmar, Chhak, Thlang, Chhim) leh Google Maps GPS Coordinate thlap thlapa chhinchhiah theihna.
Kumhlun Atana Vawn That (Lifetime Realtime Cloud): Data-te Realtime Firebase Database-ah him takin a in-sync reng a, lehkha bo emaw, phone/computer chhiat pawhin a him reng a ni.
2. Hmanraw Pawimawh leh A Thiltihtheihte (Key Features)
A. Land Pass Chhuahna (Huan Ram & In Hmun)
Huan Ram Pass (Agricultural/Garden Land) leh In Hmun Pass (Residential Site) duhtawkin a thlan theih.
Auto-Sequential Pass Number: Pass number hi a indawt zelin (e.g., VC/HR/1001, VC/IH/1001) computer-in amahin a chhiar zel a, a thar siam apiangin a hmasa aia sang zelah fel takin a inpe zela, tihsual palh a awm thei lo.
Neitu Chanchin: Neitu hming, Nu/Pa hming, Phone number, Hmun hming, leh Ram zauhzawng (Bigha, Sq.ft, etc.) chipchiar taka ziah luh theih a ni.
NOC / Document Thiltel: Council NOC emaw, ram neitu lehkha pawimawh thlalak upload-in pass-ah thil tel nghal theih a ni.
B. Google Maps GPS Coordinate & Move Tool
Google Maps Hmanraw Changkang: Huan ram leh In hmun awmna tak Google Maps Satellite (thlalak), Roadmap, leh Terrain (tlang leh ruam) hmangin a en theih.
Move Tool & Directional D-Pad:
Pin Tool: Map-ah khawi hmun pawh hmetin marker a dah nghal theih.
Move Tool (Drag/Pan): Kut emaw mouse hmangin map a pawt kual theih.
Move Pad (Hmar ⬆, Chhim ⬇, Thlang ⬅, Chhak ➡): Meter 1 (Fine), Meter 10 (Normal), leh Meter 50 (Fast) tein ramri kil (corner) tak zawnah a tawlh (nudge) theih.
My Device GPS: Council hruaituten ram an enfiah laiin an phone GPS hmangin an dinna hmun tak latitude leh longitude an la nghal thei.
C. Official A4 Size Print & Save PDF (Lehkha Phek Chhuah Dan)
A4 Portrait Fit Felfai: Print/Save PDF hmeh hian screen-a thil dang zawng zawng thup bo vekin, Official Land Pass Certificate chauh standard A4 phek khat/hnih-ah a chhuak.
Letterhead Felfai:
Veilamah: Village Council Logo / Seal.
Lai takah: OFFICE OF THE VILLAGE COUNCIL, Khaw hming, District, Block leh PIN Code (Single line-ah mawi takin a lang).
Dinglamah: Government of Mizoram (LAD) Official State Emblem.
Issue Date (Pek Chhuah Ni): Sub-header, particulars, leh President signature bulah fiah takin a lang bawk.
Pass Number & QR Code: Sequential Pass number hnuai chiahah QR Code a inhung a, a langsar nghal em em a ni.
Ramri Grid List (2x2 Grid): Hmar, Chhak, Thlang, leh Chhim ramrite bawm pali fel fai takah rem a ni.
President Seal & Signature Space:
Secretary hming lang lovin, President hming chauh a lang.
President hming hnuai chiahah official President Seal (Chhap) chhutna tur hmun ruak zau tawk dah a ni.
Veilamah Village Council Official Seal/Stamp chhutna circle a awm bawk.
Phek Hnihna (Conditions & Restriction - Dan leh Hrai): Pass hnunglam phek 2-naah Mizoram Village Council Dan hnuaia huan ram leh in hmun enkawl dan tur dan leh hrai (Terms & Conditions) a in-print tel nghal bawk.
D. QR Code Hmanga Finfiahna (Public Verification Portal)
Pass tina QR Code hi smartphone camera hmangin a scan theih a.
Internet-ah lutin Village Council hming, Pass number, Neitu hming, Ramri, Issue Date, leh GPS Coordinates a rawn tarlang nghal vek a, pass lem emaw, siamchawp a nih lohzia tute tan pawh hriat a awlsam em em a ni.
E. Village Council Profile & Settings
Khaw hming (Village Name), District, Block, leh PIN Code te ziah luh theih a ni.
Council Logo leh State Emblem thlalak upload theih a ni a, duh hunah thlak theih a ni bawk.
President Hming leh Secretary Hming thlak danglam zung zung theihna a awm.
Khawtual dan leh hrai (Custom Conditions & Terms) mahni khaw mil tura siamthat theih a ni.
Pass Serial Number intanna (Starting number) duh ang thala set theih a ni.
F. Secretary Registration & Master Authority (Hruaitu Rorelna)
Secretary Registration: V/C Secretary tharin mahni hming, phone number, leh Secret Key siamin an in-register thei.
Full Authority Approval Mode: Master Key (785392) hmangin Authority-in Secretary in-register-te an check a, an pawm (Approve) hnuah Pass thar an chhuah thei chauh thin a, hemi hian rintlak loh lakah a veng a ni.
Lifetime Live: Vawi khat pawm tawh chu chawlkar tawp lovin kumhlun atana Live a ni nghal zel.
G. Offline-First & Realtime Database Sync
Internet a chhiat emaw, signal a awm loh pawhin Local Cache hmangin Pass zawng zawng a en theih a, print theih a ni bawk.
Internet a awm leh rualin https://vclandpass.firebaseio.com/ cloud database-ah amahin a in-update nghal zung zung thin.
Audit Trail / Activity Log: Tuin nge pass siam, print, edit, emaw delete tih zawng zawng chanchin (history) fel takin a in-record vek zel bawk.
3. Mizoram Khawtlang Tana A Hlawkpuina Tlangpui
Rorelna Thianghlim: Village Council hna a tihtlangzarh a, V/C term a inthlak pawhin record a bo ve ngai lo.
Ramri Buaina Tlem Tur: GPS Coordinates leh Boundary Grid felfai tak avangin ramri innek leh inhnialna a tlem phah em em ang.
Mipuite Thlamuanna: Khawtual mipuite tan pass rintlak, bank loan lakna atana hman theih, leh sawrkar pawmpui theih certificate changtlung tak an nei thei a ni.
